<div class="totals-section"><div class="totals-card"><div class="totals-row"><span>المجموع الفرعي</span><span>${ve.totalAmount.toLocaleString("ar-EG")} ${B}</span></div>${ve.discount>0?`<div class="totals-row" style="color:#ea580c"><span>الخصم</span><span>- ${ve.discount.toLocaleString("ar-EG")} ${B}</span></div>`:""}<div class="totals-row net"><span>الإجمالي الصافي</span><span>${ve.netAmount.toLocaleString("ar-EG")} ${B}</span></div><div class="totals-row paid"><span>المبلغ المدفوع</span><span>${ve.paidAmount.toLocaleString("ar-EG")} ${B}</span></div><div class="totals-row remaining"><span>المبلغ المتبقي</span><span>${ve.remainingAmount.toLocaleString("ar-EG")} ${B}</span></div></div></div>
